<body>

<div class="header">
    <h1>Multimodal Late-Fusion Model Report</h1>
    <div style="font-size: 11pt; color: #475569; font-weight: 500;">Unified Face Authenticity Detection Against Physical & Digital Attacks</div>
</div>

<div class="meta-grid">
    <div><strong>Role:</strong> Dataset Pipeline & Multimodal Fusion Lead (Kalin)</div>
    <div><strong>Date:</strong> November 2026</div>
    <div><strong>Evaluation Test Set:</strong> 67 Distinct Video Sequences (38 Real, 29 Fake)</div>
    <div><strong>Target Framework:</strong> Late Score Fusion on Validation-Calibrated Simplex</div>
</div>

<h2>1. Executive Scorecard & Production Formula</h2>

<div class="formula-card">
    <div class="formula-title">Calibrated Late-Fusion Formulation</div>
    <div class="formula-math">p<sub>fused</sub> = 0.30 &middot; p<sub>spatial</sub> + 0.55 &middot; p<sub>frequency</sub> + 0.15 &middot; p<sub>rppg</sub></div>
    <div class="formula-sub"><strong>Decision Rule:</strong> Classify as <strong>FAKE</strong> if <em>p<sub>fused</sub> &ge; 0.35</em>, otherwise <strong>REAL</strong>.</div>
</div>

<div class="metric-grid">
    <div class="metric-card">
        <div class="metric-label">ROC-AUC</div>
        <div class="metric-value">0.9909</div>
        <div style="font-size: 7.5pt; color: #166534; font-weight: 600;">Near-Perfect Separation</div>
    </div>
    <div class="metric-card">
        <div class="metric-label">Accuracy</div>
        <div class="metric-value">97.01%</div>
        <div style="font-size: 7.5pt; color: #166534; font-weight: 600;">65 / 67 Correct</div>
    </div>
    <div class="metric-card">
        <div class="metric-label">Precision</div>
        <div class="metric-value">96.55%</div>
        <div style="font-size: 7.5pt; color: #166534; font-weight: 600;">1 False Positive</div>
    </div>
    <div class="metric-card">
        <div class="metric-label">Recall</div>
        <div class="metric-value">96.55%</div>
        <div style="font-size: 7.5pt; color: #166534; font-weight: 600;">28 / 29 Fakes Caught</div>
    </div>
</div>

