<div class="callout">
    <strong>Key Takeaway for Team:</strong> The Unified 3-Branch model achieves the highest accuracy (<strong>97.01%</strong>) and highest F1-score (<strong>0.9655</strong>). Fusing all three branches eliminates individual single-branch errors and balances precision and recall equally at 96.55%.
</div>

