<div class="callout-warn">
    <strong>Fault-Tolerance Observation:</strong> Under bad illumination, standalone rPPG AUC collapses to <strong>0.3553</strong> (random noise) and Frequency drops to 0.7368. However, because Spatial ViT maintains 1.0000 AUC, the <strong>Fused Model stays solid at 0.9737 AUC</strong>, successfully proving environmental fault-tolerance.
</div>

<h2>5. Ready-to-Use Python Code for Team Integration</h2>
<pre>
# Production Late Fusion Decision Function
FUSION_WEIGHTS = {"spatial": 0.30, "frequency": 0.55, "rppg": 0.15}
DECISION_THRESHOLD = 0.35

def predict_authenticity(p_spatial: float, p_frequency: float, p_rppg: float) -> dict:
    """
    Computes calibrated late fusion probability and authenticity decision.
    All inputs must be float probabilities in [0.0, 1.0] representing P(Fake).
    """
    fused_score = (
        FUSION_WEIGHTS["spatial"] * p_spatial +
        FUSION_WEIGHTS["frequency"] * p_frequency +
        FUSION_WEIGHTS["rppg"] * p_rppg
    )
    is_fake = bool(fused_score >= DECISION_THRESHOLD)
    return {
        "is_fake": is_fake,
        "label": "FAKE" if is_fake else "REAL",
        "fused_score": round(float(fused_score), 4),
        "confidence": round(float(fused_score if is_fake else 1.0 - fused_score), 4)
    }
</pre>

